  {
   "text": "Sam hikes with two poles and a dog that pulls.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.12
  },
  {
   "text": "On the steep part he had no hand left.",
   "start": 3.22,
   "end": 5.35
  },
  {
   "text": "The fix: clip the leash to a waist belt, so a pull goes through your hips.",
   "start": 5.6,
   "end": 9.571
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep it short near people.",
   "start": 9.721,
   "end": 11.075
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this.",
   "start": 11.375,
   "end": 12.079
  }
